ynamic expressive platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment to learn a full suite of movement techniques, and use them to your advantage to rise above the crypt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful weapons and bracelets, each with their own quirks and synergies to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel twisting routes in an intertwined, non-linear underworld that whispers its forgotten history across scattered item inscriptions.</p></li></ul>","developers":["mattlawrdev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1396870/42f3be6ef39b45afd3bc8e03d3250528e237e3af/header.jpg?t=1771001920","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1396870/1589583365/67f2fdda69886872818a832989ae7a5aaa942cd3/1769112993/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769115604","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1396870/1589583365/67f2fdda69886872818a832989ae7a5aaa942cd3/1769112993/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769115604","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1396870/1589583365/67f2fdda69886872818a832989ae7a5aaa942cd3/1769112993/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769115604","id":257270558,"name":"Early Access Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257270558/be41556dcb3d67a68d5ad6533707a56c09a25cde/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769115604"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai